{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:c7df4b55bf83a8a5","name":"Quicksand","source":{"id":"source:reference-c7df4b55bf83a8a5","title":"Quicksand","revision":21414,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:45:37Z","sha256":"6eb83d8b7b091d44d1b8de357d6dc07d68dabb6ddaf8c2815139d793303b440e","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21414","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Quicksand&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-c7df4b55bf83a8a5","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["A deep bog is covered with sand and other natural objects, making it virtually unnoticeable."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The hidden danger of Quicksand can be exploited by beings fighting in forests or jungles. Aside from its most obvious use as a trap, Quicksand can also be an excellent hiding place- as long as those using it can get out in a reasonable amount of time. Quicksand can also serve as an obstacle preventing heroes from obtaining a specific item or artifact. If the desired item is cast into the Quicksand, at least one of the heroes must risk his or her life to retrieve it.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Quicksand Statistics (CL 8)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Keywords:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Natural"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Natural"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Trigger:"]}," A being begins its turn on Quicksand.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Attack:"]}," +10 vs ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 2d8 (-1 step on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},")\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Recurrence:"]}," On Trigger\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," The following are suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," for this Hazard:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," (DC 23):"]}," The character detects the Quicksand before they reach it, gaining a +5 circumstance bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," to avoid the Hazard. This bonus stacks with the bonus they receive from a successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Survival"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Survival","referenceId":"reference:8302496de0ace160"}," check against the Hazard."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Survival"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Survival","referenceId":"reference:8302496de0ace160"}," (DC 23):"]}," The character determines the boundaries of the Quicksand and gains a +5 circumstance bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," to avoid the Hazard. This bonus stacks with the bonus they receive from a successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check against the Hazard."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Swim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swim","referenceId":"reference:dd4fa375c70c4e42"}," (DC 28):"]}," The character escapes from the Quicksand at the end of the round."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," A creature caught in Quicksand sinks into it over a period of 5 rounds. If the creature fully sinks into the Quicksand, it can hold its breath for a number of rounds equal to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," score before it must begin making ",{"tag":"a","children":["Endurance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endurance","referenceId":"reference:98c8abf84e23ff3f"}," checks to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hold Breath"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hold_Breath"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
